@host = https://localhost:7001
@token = pdr-2026

### 1. POST sin token -> 401 Unauthorized
POST {{host}}/api/v1/heroes
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nombreReal": "Bruce Wayne",
  "nombre": "Batman",
  "edad": 40,
  "creadores": ["Bob Kane", "Bill Finger"]
}

### 2. Crear Batman -> 201 Created, Location y ETag "v1"
POST {{host}}/api/v1/heroes
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nombreReal": "Bruce Wayne",
  "nombre": "Batman",
  "edad": 40,
  "creadores": ["Bob Kane", "Bill Finger"]
}

### 3. Crear Superman
POST {{host}}/api/v1/heroes
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nombreReal": "Clark Kent",
  "nombre": "Superman",
  "edad": 35,
  "creadores": ["Jerry Siegel", "Joe Shuster"]
}

### 4. Crear Spider-Man
POST {{host}}/api/v1/heroes
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nombreReal": "Peter Parker",
  "nombre": "Spider-Man",
  "edad": 24,
  "creadores": ["Stan Lee", "Steve Ditko"]
}

### 5. Obtener todos
GET {{host}}/api/v1/heroes

### 6. Filtrar por parte del nombre
GET {{host}}/api/v1/heroes?nombre=man

### 7. Filtrar por edad y ordenar
GET {{host}}/api/v1/heroes?edadMinima=30&ordenarPor=edad&descendente=true

### 8. Filtrar por creador
GET {{host}}/api/v1/heroes?creador=Bob%20Kane

### 9. Paginar
GET {{host}}/api/v1/heroes?pagina=1&tamanioPagina=2&ordenarPor=nombre

### 10. Filtro inválido -> 400 mediante IExceptionHandler
GET {{host}}/api/v1/heroes?tamanioPagina=100

### 11. Obtener Batman -> observar ETag "v1" y Cache-Control
GET {{host}}/api/v1/heroes/1

### 12. GET condicional -> si Batman sigue en v1, 304 Not Modified
GET {{host}}/api/v1/heroes/1
If-None-Match: "v1"

### 13. Actualizar Batman con la versión correcta -> 204 y nuevo ETag "v2"
PUT {{host}}/api/v1/heroes/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
If-Match: "v1"
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nombreReal": "Bruce Wayne",
  "nombre": "Batman",
  "edad": 41,
  "creadores": ["Bob Kane", "Bill Finger"]
}

### 14. Intentar actualizar usando el ETag viejo -> 412 Precondition Failed
PUT {{host}}/api/v1/heroes/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
If-Match: "v1"
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nombreReal": "Bruce Wayne",
  "nombre": "Batman",
  "edad": 42,
  "creadores": ["Bob Kane", "Bill Finger"]
}

### 15. Actualizar con la versión actual -> 204 y ETag "v3"
PUT {{host}}/api/v1/heroes/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
If-Match: "v2"
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nombreReal": "Bruce Wayne",
  "nombre": "Batman",
  "edad": 42,
  "creadores": ["Bob Kane", "Bill Finger"]
}

### 16. Recurso inexistente -> 404 mediante IExceptionHandler
GET {{host}}/api/v1/heroes/999

### 17. Eliminar sin token -> 401
DELETE {{host}}/api/v1/heroes/1

### 18. Eliminar con token -> 204
DELETE {{host}}/api/v1/heroes/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 19. Repetir DELETE -> 404; el recurso sigue eliminado
DELETE {{host}}/api/v1/heroes/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
